@CLMS_APIs_HostAddress = http://localhost:5191
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Test Login with Valid Credentials
POST {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Test Login with Missing Fields (400 Bad Request)
POST {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 3. Test Login with Invalid Credentials (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "nonexistent_user",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### 4. GET All Companies (Ordered by Name)
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. GET Company By ID
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/companies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. POST Create New Company
POST {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="CompanyName"

ABC Infra Private Limited
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="CompanyAddress"

Plot No. 45, Industrial Area, Phase II
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Email"

contact@abcinfra.com
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Phone"

+91-9876543210
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ContactPerson"

Rajesh Sharma
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="GressTime"

15
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="RegFingerCount"

2
--boundary--

### 7. PUT Update Company
PUT {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/companies/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="CompanyName"

ABC Infrastructure Tech Ltd
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="CompanyAddress"

Plot No. 45, New Industrial Area, Phase II
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Email"

info@abcinfra.com
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ContactPerson"

Rajesh Kumar Sharma
--boundary--

### 8. DELETE Company
DELETE {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/companies/2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. GET All Contractors (All Statuses)
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. GET Active Contractors (ValidDt >= today)
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. GET Inactive / Expired Contractors (ValidDt < today)
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors?active=false
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. GET Contractor Types Lookup
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors/lookup/types
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. GET Contractor By ID
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. POST Create Contractor (JSON)
POST {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Apex Engineering Solutions",
  "address": "Plot 12, MIDC Industrial Area, Pune",
  "phone": "+91 20 2712 3456",
  "email": "contact@apexeng.com",
  "description": "Mechanical and civil maintenance",
  "esiPay": true,
  "pfPay": true,
  "salPayFlag": true,
  "contPerNm": "Suresh Patil",
  "contPerPhone": "+91 9823012345",
  "stdLStrength": 50,
  "validDt": "2027-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "licNo": "LIC-MH-2026-9901",
  "adharNo": "987654321012",
  "panNo": "ABCDE1234F"
}

### 15. POST Create Contractor Duplicate Test (409 Conflict with field identifier)
POST {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Apex Engineering Solutions",
  "licNo": "LIC-MH-2026-9901",
  "adharNo": "987654321012",
  "panNo": "ABCDE1234F"
}

### 16. DELETE Contractor (Check 409 Conflict if active employees linked)
DELETE {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/api/contractors/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 17. WeatherForecast Sample
GET {{CLMS_APIs_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

